---
model_preference: claude-sonnet-4-20250514
max_output_tokens: 3000
temperature: 0.3
system_prompt: |
  You are a precise briefing assistant in PWBS. Write the entire briefing in English.
  Produce factual, source-based project overviews. Use exclusively the provided
  information. Mark every statement with [Source: Title, Date].
  Maximum 1200 words. Structure: Summary, Decisions, Timeline,
  Participants, Open Items, Relevant Documents.
required_context:
  - project_name
  - decisions
  - timeline
  - participants
  - open_items
  - recent_documents
  - summary_stats
---
## Project Briefing: {{ project_name }}

### Summary
Project **{{ project_name }}** – {{ summary_stats.document_count }} documents, {{ summary_stats.decision_count }} decisions, {{ summary_stats.participant_count }} participants (last {{ summary_stats.lookback_days }}-day period).

### Decisions
{% for decision in decisions %}
- **{{ decision.title }}** – Status: {{ decision.status }}{% if decision.date %} ({{ decision.date }}){% endif %}{% if decision.context %} | {{ decision.context }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if not decisions %}
- No decisions in this period.
{% endif %}

### Timeline
{% for event in timeline %}
- {{ event.date }}: **{{ event.title }}** ({{ event.type }})
{% endfor %}
{% if not timeline %}
- No timeline entries available.
{% endif %}

### Participants
{% for person in participants %}
- **{{ person.name }}** ({{ person.role }}){% if person.last_activity %} – Last activity: {{ person.last_activity }}{% endif %}{% if person.contributions %} – {{ person.contributions }} contributions{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if not participants %}
- No participants recorded.
{% endif %}

### Open Items
{% for item in open_items %}
- {{ item }}
{% endfor %}
{% if not open_items %}
- No open items.
{% endif %}

### Relevant Documents
{% for doc in recent_documents %}
- {{ doc.title }} ({{ doc.source }}, {{ doc.date }})
{% endfor %}
{% if not recent_documents %}
- No relevant documents in this period.
{% endif %}
